DrawingML charts: initialize omitted varyColors for modern documents

Modern Excel treats an omitted c:varyColors as enabled. The importer used
false for the absent element while using true when the element existed
without val. This flattened single-series bar and pie charts to one color.

Initialize classic-chart models using the modern/Office-2007 distinction
from the Boolean parser. Explicit false/true continue to override it.
Do not apply classic-chart defaults to unrelated ChartEx models.
Keep chart-type and multiple-series restrictions in the converter; do not
change the theme palette, automatic styles or explicit shape formatting.

diff --git a/oox/source/drawingml/chart/typegroupmodel.cxx b/oox/source/drawingml/chart/typegroupmodel.cxx
--- a/oox/source/drawingml/chart/typegroupmodel.cxx
+++ b/oox/source/drawingml/chart/typegroupmodel.cxx
